        <item>
            <title>2.21.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 10:34:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>99</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.21.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- **MacroPad: "Pad is rotated 180°"** (Settings → General → MacroPad). For a pad mounted upside-down. It flips both directions at once — the key a pane lights up on, and the pane a key focuses — so the leftmost pane always answers on the key that *looks* leftmost. Off by default; the sleep chord still works from the two outermost keys either way round.

### Changes
- MacroPad now records an orientation change, a key press that lands past the open panes, and a non-boolean rotation setting in the unified log, so a pad that behaves unexpectedly can be diagnosed without guesswork.

### Bug Fixes
- Settings are written once, after loading finishes, instead of after each individual value is read. Previously a load that was interrupted partway could leave a preference on disk replaced by its default.
]]></description>
